        "涉及离线/本地优先运行时,如 VITE_WEB_RUNTIME_PROFILE=desktop-phase1-offline、App SQLite(SQLCipher)、xai-desktop-layout localStorage 键(ADR-0013 D3 W2 引用此离线 profile)",
